# Key-only login for the test user. Forwarding stays off because devlanes only
# needs a session channel (design-draft section 5).
AllowUsers devlanes
PermitRootLogin no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
AllowTcpForwarding no
AllowStreamLocalForwarding no
AllowAgentForwarding no
X11Forwarding no
PermitTunnel no
